OL,3,GNEWSAChild, 7, 'critical' following
OL,4,Acollision between bicycle and car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seven-year-old boy is in a critical
OL,7,Fbut stable condition in hospital
OL,8,Ffollowing a road traffic collision in
OL,9,FColeraine.
OL,11,FPolice said the boy had been riding his
OL,12,Fbicycle when he was involved in a
OL,13,Fcollision with a black Volkswagen
OL,14,FScirocco in the Warnocks Lane area at
OL,15,Fabout 18:40 on Sunday.
OL,17,FEmergency services attended the scene
OL,18,Fand the boy was taken to hospital.
OL,20,FWarnocks Lane was closed in both
OL,21,Fdirections for a time but has since
OL,22,Freopened.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
